    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061117.0086\n\nBERLIN, Nov. 17 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nGerman stocks open lower\n\n\n\n\nGerman stocks opened lower Friday on the Frankfurt market.\n\nThe 30-share DAX Index dropped 0.01 percent or 0.67 points to 6,442.35 at 09:03 a.m. (0803 GMT).\n\nThe MDAX index of medium-sized companies was down 0.13 percent or 11.45 points to 8,931.86.\n\nThe TecDAX index of technologies and science firms was down 0.29 percent to 706.31 points.",
